


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_aacc10c2:



    voice "2RI_0332"
    rin "「我回来了——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_1224b532:


    "伦神采飞扬地打开门后，回到了宿舍里。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_2ae55f3c:



    voice "2FU_0280"
    fumi "「只不过没人在呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_0d3e2816:


    "文紧跟伦身后回来。然后轻轻地关上了门。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_598b4e18:



    voice "2RI_0333"
    rin "「没错。也就是说二人独处啦～♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_06e74acc:


    "心情好到几乎要转起圈了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_8d61fa96:



    voice "2FU_0281"
    fumi "「要好好感谢给我们腾出这个时间的夏目同学哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_3122e65e:



    voice "2RI_0334"
    rin "「待会给阳菜发个压岁钱吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_f513f22f:



    voice "2FU_0282"
    fumi "「你又来了。明明只要说句谢谢就能表达心意了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_19bd4dc4:



    voice "2RI_0335"
    rin "「又是年末年初的留宿会，又是碰上鹰冈同学入住，确实很久没有二人独处了呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_bc88e6dc:


    "文叹了口气然后苦笑了一下。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_21af26d3:



    voice "2FU_0283"
    fumi "「鹰冈同学那边的话估计已经露馅了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_04d6d83e:



    voice "2RI_0336"
    rin "「是吗？圣诞节之后我们相处得不是挺小心谨慎的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_4cbe89e4:


    "诶？"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_975c4c0f:



    voice "2FU_0284"
    fumi "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_c06dcd96:


    "……就知道。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_d24400c8:



    voice "2RI_0337B"
    rin "「文——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_9f534806:


    "（自称）贞洁贤淑的伦发出撒娇的声音并准备往文那抱去。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_d02f7cc6:



    voice "2FU_0285"
    fumi "「啊，等一下。LIME有信息——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_be5cdf13:



    voice "2RI_0338"
    rin "「噗叽」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_633499c3:


    "文用手指挡住了伦嘴唇的攻势，把视线落到手机的画面上。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_b3fafa6b:



    voice "2FU_0286"
    fumi "「嗯，是小礼发过来的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_ac2a5299:



    voice "2RI_0339"
    rin "「礼……啊啊，是你的弟弟吗。他说什么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_f0025d65:



    voice "2FU_0287"
    fumi "「他说找不到卡包了所以问我有没见到。那孩子，真是什么都到处乱扔的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_e155d795:


    "有着同样坏习惯的孩子在你面前也还有一个。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_bdf8d2ce:



    voice "2RI_0340"
    rin "「要是把月票弄丢了的话，估计会很头痛吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_5bf99870:


    "不知是否因为不安，伦也从大衣的口袋里掏出了卡包。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_b4c75cf8:



    voice "2FU_0288"
    fumi "「就是啊。伦你也得注意——啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_054a9308:


    "文再次确认了一下伦手上的卡包。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_e15b10ef:



    voice "2FU_0289"
    fumi "「不好意思啊，伦你能不能也检查下衣服另一边的口袋呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_b48c0930:



    voice "2RI_0341"
    rin "「嗯？这边没东西——咦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_9591e7a6:


    "这边的口袋也冒出了一个卡包。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_863e135f:



    voice "2RI_0342"
    rin "「变多了！？拍拍口袋结果卡包变两个了？是不可思议的口袋吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_874cec2a:


    "伦拍了拍口袋，当然没再继续变出卡包了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_d564e7ec:



    voice "2FU_0290"
    fumi "「不是那样啦。你好好看一下，一开始拿出来的那个，估计就是小礼的了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_d88e30d0:


    "伦把卡包打开来然后确认了一下月票的正面。使用者的名字是「浅生礼」。那是文的弟弟的名字。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_8408d52f:



    voice "2RI_0343B"
    rin "「真的啊！呃，咦？不过这个卡包和我的是同款的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_64b1a5aa:



    voice "2FU_0291"
    fumi "「看上去确实非常像，不过稍微有点点不一样的。比如这里的针工之类的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_dc10862b:



    voice "2RI_0344"
    rin "「真的是呢。你一眼就能认出来吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_7caf33bc:



    voice "2FU_0292"
    fumi "「小礼的卡包是以前他生日时我送他的礼物来的。而伦的话我每天都能看见嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_64514f29:


    "因为每天都要递东西给伦，结果比伦她自己还清楚伦的东西了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_4b8aa8e8:



    voice "2RI_0345"
    rin "「啊啊～大概当时是放在鞋柜上面了吧。因为超级像的所以我想都没想就当成是自己的了。真的非常对不住啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_8d795a6f:


    "不过也怪这个卡包不打开就看不见里面。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_9db25635:



    voice "2FU_0293"
    fumi "「说到底，把东西随便扔在那种地方的小礼也有错」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_56a5611b:



    voice "2RI_0346"
    rin "「没。不事先确认一下就往口袋里塞的我才该背这个锅。还有之后没注意到这点也是」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_9e3517c2:



    voice "2FU_0294"
    fumi "「没关系的。反正在新学期开学前我应该还会回一趟家。到时还回去就可以了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_204e8c6e:


    "文说着，开始回信息给她的弟弟。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_49d06b23:



    voice "2RI_0347"
    rin "「抱歉啊。作为赔罪我帮他充值一下吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_345f8439:


    "看来歉意很深呢。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_7c4fc111:



    voice "2FU_0295"
    fumi "「………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_a862b88f:


    "发完信息后，文关掉了应用直视着伦的脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_e498be7d:



    voice "2RI_0348"
    rin "「嗯，怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_62166055:



    voice "2FU_0296"
    fumi "「留宿会，你是硬着头皮去的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_1cd931b2:



    voice "2RI_0349"
    rin "「诶诶！？为什么突然那样问？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_1dac7ce6:



    voice "2FU_0297"
    fumi "「因为你非常紧张的吧？我家也好夏目同学家也好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_1459c92a:



    voice "2RI_0350"
    rin "「哪、哪有那种事——呃，穿帮了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_0c28edcb:



    voice "2FU_0298"
    fumi "「嗯。你看都拿错卡包了——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_c50030a7:



    voice "2RI_0351"
    rin "「不不不。我平时基本也就那个德行的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_e252f1f8:



    voice "2FU_0299"
    fumi "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_f6b19fc1:



    voice "2RI_0352"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_230da8eb:



    voice "2FU_0300"
    fumi "「无论在谁家，伦都是婉婉有仪的样子呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_370bfbd6:



    voice "2RI_0353"
    rin "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_9cced8c5:


    "话题开始转变了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_e82d1469:



    voice "2FU_0301"
    fumi "「和我爸爸妈妈都很聊得开呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_61cec211:



    voice "2RI_0354"
    rin "「啊～我只有在外面才那样啦。而且阳菜也跟我说过的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_2e9ed86c:



    voice "2FU_0302"
    fumi "「其实你很不擅长这个的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_21c394c8:



    voice "2RI_0355"
    rin "「……啊、嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_c1e08847:


    "反正就算掩饰也是会穿帮的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_66f81995:



    voice "2RI_0356"
    rin "「啊！当然我不是指文的家人让人很难应付的意思哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_7c4fc111_1:



    voice "2FU_0295"
    fumi "「………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_a7ba5f34:


    "如果说伦是像平常那样大大咧咧的话，估计反而会让文更放心一点了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_a23ffe25:


    "不过无论是在夏目家还是在浅生家，伦都表现得无与伦比。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_0a00ff75:


    "正因为文知晓伦平时的习性，才清楚伦一直都在绷紧着的吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_798f8b2f:



    voice "2FU_0304"
    fumi "「抱歉——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_8110fbe5:



    voice "2RI_0357"
    rin "「其实我真的玩的很开心」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_7e100918:


    "文没能把对不起说到最后。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_70c7f11e:



    voice "2RI_0358"
    rin "「因为我是第一次和大家一起过年嘛。而且如果不是文和阳菜拉着我的话，我也没法体验到了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_3055ae78:



    voice "2RI_0359"
    rin "「你看啊，毕竟我这个人是公认的怕生嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_7c4fc111_2:



    voice "2FU_0295"
    fumi "「………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_547c79d0:


    "我也认同。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_9d8a871c:



    voice "2RI_0360"
    rin "「所以啊，和第一次见面的人接触交流时要耗费更多的能量。只不过那并不意味着我一定会讨厌哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_65485ebe:



    voice "2FU_0306"
    fumi "「这样……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_f9e0b1d2:


    "文的表情缓和了不少。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_e1fa16c2:



    voice "2RI_0361"
    rin "「而且你看！这是我第一次跟岳父岳母打招呼嘛！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_2cd6a323:


    "啊，伦怎么把这话说出来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_bfbba65d:



    voice "2FU_0307"
    fumi "「那么要什么时候才来个正式点的问候呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_79ab33ef:



    voice "2RI_0362"
    rin "「呃……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_72f56aa6:


    "看，明知自己会被反杀的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_fe3a056b:



    voice "2FU_0308"
    fumi "「那等时机成熟了……就拜托你咯」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_744dac8f:



    voice "2RI_0363"
    rin "「呜……啊……好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_7598f8a6:


    "文放了伦一马。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_c8a3571b:



    voice "2FU_0309"
    fumi "「呵呵呵……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_4477f5c6:



    voice "2RI_0364"
    rin "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_ce5662e9:


    "文趁着伦仍然魂不守舍的时候把脸凑上去了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_be90799f:



    voice "2FU_0310"
    fumi "「……来做吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_7eb69565:


    "她并没有给伦喘息的机会，紧接着就是甜蜜而巧妙的伎俩。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_c611618e:


    "文顺势缓缓地将伦推倒在床上。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_03_0fd4d656:


    "…………"
